  "description": "Gravel Racing, Redefined. The Kaius 01 is the result of BMC’s obsession with gravel speed. Engineered in the Impec Lab with cutting-edge carbon technology, it’s purpose-built for competitive gravel racing. Its race-optimized geometry delivers the ideal mix of stiffness, low weight, and compliance - enhancing traction, stability, and climbing efficiency across demanding terrain. With the RSM01 stem featuring ICS cable integration and our new aluminum HB-D4-03 handlebar, our Aerocore design, this bike cuts through the wind and charges ahead. Equipped with top-tier components like the newest SRAM Rival AXS XPLR, and CG 40 carbon wheels, the Kaius 01 is ready to chase podiums and push boundaries on every ride.",
